  "source_branch": "sim2real",
  "scope": "G1 native-camera and Fast-FoundationStereo deployment",
  "adaptations": [
    "Explicit model paths and relay endpoints instead of private defaults.",
    "Portable launchers, virtual-environment installation, and source-pinned FFS submodule.",
    "FFS adapter defaults to the local submodule; optional GUM prediction remains excluded.",
    "OpenCV contrib supplies the shared cv2 package; camera and relay dependencies are declared.",
    "Remote stereo rejects malformed packet lengths before array decoding.",
    "Depth startup checks preserve the source saturation exception and additionally check every sampled frame.",
    "Remote camera services are opt-in; diagnostic recording is opt-in; GPU diagnostics are read-only.",
    "Whitespace and comments cleaned without changing the source controller or depth algorithms."
